title: attack_won
---

Narrator:
The reports come through in fragments.

First the silence.

Then confirmation.

---

Narrator:
Your ships are still.

No drift. No correction.

The engagement is over.

---

Narrator:
The system changes hands.

Not dramatically.

A flag removed.
A new registration filed.

The archive accepts it without comment.

---

Narrator:
You check the fleet strength.

<<if $remaining_strength > 8>>
    Narrator:
    Better than expected.

    Narrator:
    Whoever defended that system — they held longer than the models predicted.

    Narrator:
    You take note of that.

<<elseif $remaining_strength > 3>>
    Narrator:
    Acceptable losses.

    Narrator:
    You've paid more for less.

<<else>>
    Narrator:
    The numbers are worse than you wanted.

    Narrator:
    The system is yours.

    Narrator:
    The question is whether you can hold it.

<<endif>>

---

Narrator:
Control is a temporary condition.

You've taken enough systems to know that.

---

-> [Acknowledge]

===

title: attack_repulsed
---

Narrator:
The contact window closes before you expect it.

---

Narrator:
Your ships are withdrawing.

Not routed — the distinction matters to some people.

To the fleet logs, it matters.

---

Narrator:
The system did not fall.

---

Narrator:
You review the engagement data.

There is always something in the data.

Resistance levels.
Fleet ratios.
Timing.

---

<<if $remaining_strength > 5>>
    Narrator:
    The fleet survived. That's the important part.

    Narrator:
    You came close.

    Narrator:
    Close enough to learn something.

<<else>>
    Narrator:
    The losses are significant.

    Narrator:
    You've committed more to worse outcomes.

    Narrator:
    But this one stings.

<<endif>>

---

Narrator:
You mark the system.

Not for now.

---

Narrator:
But noted.

---

-> [Acknowledge]

===

title: attack_commit
---
Narrator: Fleet committed to assault.

The approach vector is locked. There is no negotiation at the end of this vector — only outcome.

Engage when ready.
===
